[0.1.4]
* Lower the default Cloudron memory limit from 1 GiB to 512 MiB based on upstream deployment sizing and constrained runtime testing.
* Improve dependency-layer reuse across upstream source changes with content-addressed manifest/vendor stages while remaining compatible with Cloudron's non-BuildKit on-server builder.
* Assign final runtime ownership during COPY to avoid duplicating the application tree in a recursive chown layer.
* Exclude upstream test sources from the production runtime image after the build-stage test suite completes.

[0.1.3]
* Update Instatic from 0.0.16 to 0.0.17.
* Preserve the Cloudron PostgreSQL, persistent uploads, runtime secret, public-origin, and sendmail integration contracts.

[0.1.2]
* Force PLAIN authentication for Cloudron's trusted internal SMTP relay; msmtp excludes cleartext methods from automatic selection when TLS is disabled.

[0.1.1]
* Pass the generated Cloudron msmtp configuration explicitly to sendmail.

[0.1.0]
* Initial Cloudron Community App package for Instatic 0.0.16.
* Use Cloudron-managed PostgreSQL and persistent storage under /app/data.
* Generate and persist INSTATIC_SECRET_KEY automatically.
* Add Cloudron sendmail transport for public form notifications.
* Add health checks, tests, release metadata, and operator documentation.
